.PP
computes nodal forces weighted by node Interpolates the applied element-centric forces to the nodes\&.

.PP
An approach is used where the nodal contribution is weighted on the basis of the distance of the barycenter to the node\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
this is an integration (for uniform nodal forces, see option, we get non-uniform stresses) 
.RE
.PP

